opaque marker). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.E2Degenerates.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.E2Degenerates.mk","kind":"ctor","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L59-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.E2Degenerates","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.E2Degenerates","kind":"class","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L56-L61","doc":"Conditional class axiomatising E₂-degeneration of a spectral\nsequence. NEAR-MATCH tier; instance not constructed (requires\nupstream Hochschild / KLR machinery). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.d","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The differential at level `r` (positions are `ℤ`; the level shift\n`r` is cast to `ℤ` explicitly to avoid mixed `ℕ`/`ℤ` addition). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.E","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.E","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The page indexed by level `r`, position `(p, q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.mk","kind":"ctor","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage","kind":"structure","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L35-L48","doc":"**Spectral sequence page** at level `r`: a `(p, q)`-graded object\n`E r p q` together with a differential `d r : E r p q → E r (p+r) (q+1-r)`.\n\nEncoded type-level only; the actual Mathlib spectral-sequence\ninfrastructure would land in `Mathlib.Algebra.Homology.SpectralSequence`\nwhen categorified upstream. (A base ring is intentionally NOT a\nparameter — the pages are bare graded types at this scaffold level;\nan `R`-linear refinement is future work.) ","signatureChunk":0}]}